Guha sights oceanlike flagged army by Gaṅgā --- Guha rallies kinsmen fearing attack or capture --- Guha suspects Bharata comes to kill exiled Rāma --- Guha arrays meat-eating guards and five hundred boats --- Guha declares army crosses only if friendly to Rāma --- Guha approaches Bharata with fish meat and honey --- Sumantra introduces Guha as Rāma aged forest friend --- Bharata grants audience and Guha offers lodging and food
